1 0 obj<</Author(ariesnoctua \(SleepyMaddy\))/CreationDate(D:20261101021912+00'00')/Creator(calibre \(9.17.0\) [https://calibre-ebook.com])/Keywords(Fanworks, Teen And Up Audiences, She-Ra and the Princesses of Power \(2018\), Adora/Catra \(She-Ra\), Adora \(She-Ra\), Catra \(She-Ra\), other characters make an appearance but are not central, 5+1 Things, POV Catra \(She-Ra\), POV Adora \(She-Ra\), sequences 1 to 5 cover scenes from the show, in order:, s1e9: No Princess Left Behind, s1e11: Promise, s2e5: White Out, s3e3: Once Upon A Time In The Waste, s3e4: Moment of Truth, and then for the +1, Post-Canon, technically number 5 isn't catra wielding the sword but, close enough, Angst with a Happy Ending, technically? angst with a sharp turn into not-angst-at-all?, catra's having a bad time but it gets better, +1 is basically a post-canon fluff one shot, it got away from me a bit, this whole thing is mostly an excuse to give catra a sword, F/F, No Archive Warnings Apply)/ModDate(D:20261101021912+00'00')/Producer(calibre \(9.17.0\) [https://calibre-ebook.com])/Title(tiebreaker)>>
